    "text": "**Don't** adds *-ma* or *-me* to the stem: *Gitme!*, *Gorkma!* Politely or to several people, *-maň* or *-mäň*, with *ä* after a front vowel: *Gelmäň!*, *Okamaň!*, *Alada etmäň!*",
    "see": "gp-imperative"
  },
